01:03:33,480 --> 01:03:34,320
Hey,

1651
01:03:34,600 --> 01:03:35,440
(Direct invitation)
Xingxu, come, follow me.

1652
01:03:36,040 --> 01:03:37,320
Wait, why?

1653
01:03:37,320 --> 01:03:39,000
I'm taking a wild guess.
Come, follow me.

1654
01:03:39,000 --> 01:03:41,160
Wait, I don't dare follow you right now.

1655
01:03:41,160 --> 01:03:41,760
(Cautious)
You and me.

1656
01:03:41,760 --> 01:03:43,320
I don't dare follow you
right now either.

1657
01:03:43,320 --> 01:03:44,160
Us two.

1658
01:03:44,160 --> 01:03:45,480
Xingxu, follow me. It's fine.

1659
01:03:46,440 --> 01:03:46,880
You follow me.

1660
01:03:47,680 --> 01:03:48,520
(Could Liu Yuning be the security guard?)
I think you're good.

1661
01:03:48,520 --> 01:03:49,216
Really?

1662
01:03:50,360 --> 01:03:51,120
Can I really trust you?

1663
01:03:51,120 --> 01:03:51,808
I think you're good.

1664
01:03:51,808 --> 01:03:52,400
No.

1665
01:03:52,400 --> 01:03:53,560
Don't touch me.

1666
01:03:57,560 --> 01:03:58,960
Xingxu, let's go together.

1667
01:03:58,960 --> 01:03:59,520
No.

1668
01:03:59,904 --> 01:04:00,520
Honglei,

1669
01:04:00,520 --> 01:04:03,280
(Running away)
I can't be alone with you right now either.

1670
01:04:03,440 --> 01:04:04,400
Xingxu, listen to me.

1671
01:04:05,400 --> 01:04:06,800
I'll listen to you, okay?

1672
01:04:06,800 --> 01:04:07,584
(I'm not picky)

1673
01:04:09,240 --> 01:04:10,800
I'll listen to you.

1674
01:04:10,800 --> 01:04:12,360
I don't really trust you, bro.

1675
01:04:12,360 --> 01:04:14,600
You're too proactive in this round.

1676
01:04:14,600 --> 01:04:15,424
(As if he is another Honglei?)

1677
01:04:18,400 --> 01:04:19,520
(Correct mirror)

1678
01:04:19,520 --> 01:04:19,960
Red one.

1679
01:04:20,480 --> 01:04:21,680
I saw one.

1680
01:04:22,520 --> 01:04:24,080
(Need cooperation to complete verification)
But you need someone to help you make the phone call,

1681
01:04:24,080 --> 01:04:24,480
right?

1682
01:04:24,480 --> 01:04:24,920
Yeah.

1683
01:04:25,160 --> 01:04:25,960
So you follow me.

1684
01:04:28,160 --> 01:04:28,680
No.

1685
01:04:28,680 --> 01:04:30,400
I think three will also do.

1686
01:04:30,840 --> 01:04:31,440
(Three as a crowd is safer)
Three people.

1687
01:04:31,880 --> 01:04:32,640
Three people is okay.

1688
01:04:33,040 --> 01:04:33,664
That works.

1689
01:04:33,664 --> 01:04:34,120
Okay.

1690
01:04:34,120 --> 01:04:35,560
One mirror can only reflect
one person at a time.

1691
01:04:35,560 --> 01:04:36,640
One person at a time, right?

1692
01:04:36,640 --> 01:04:37,600
Let's do yours first.

1693
01:04:37,600 --> 01:04:38,080
I'll go first.

1694
01:04:38,400 --> 01:04:38,880
You go first.

1695
01:04:38,880 --> 01:04:39,440
Let's do yours first.

1696
01:04:39,840 --> 01:04:40,960
(Hand gesture coordination)
A love song, right?

1697
01:04:40,960 --> 01:04:41,600
Yes.

1698
01:04:41,600 --> 01:04:42,960
Just sing one line, a full line.

1699
01:04:43,480 --> 01:04:44,600
♪You say you♪

1700
01:04:46,880 --> 01:04:47,320
You...

1701
01:04:50,000 --> 01:04:51,240
No, just kidding.

1702
01:04:51,240 --> 01:04:51,920
Hurry.

1703
01:04:51,920 --> 01:04:53,040
(Continue singing)
Just kidding.

1704
01:04:53,040 --> 01:04:54,480
♪Want to escape♪

1705
01:04:54,480 --> 01:04:56,600
♪But destined to settle down♪

1706
01:04:56,600 --> 01:04:57,240
(Verified)
Okay, good.

1707
01:04:57,240 --> 01:04:57,880
Let's go, follow me.

1708
01:04:57,880 --> 01:04:58,800
You two follow me.

1709
01:04:58,800 --> 01:04:59,200
Let's go together.

1710
01:04:59,200 --> 01:05:00,000
Hurry up.

1711
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:00,680
The mirror will be gone soon.

1712
01:05:00,680 --> 01:05:01,560
Let's go.

1713
01:05:01,560 --> 01:05:02,400
The three of us cooperate.

1714
01:05:02,880 --> 01:05:03,520
(Three people forming a group)

1715
01:05:03,520 --> 01:05:05,000
(Qian and Nai reunite)
How about this? Ally with me.

1716
01:05:05,360 --> 01:05:06,000
Okay.

1717
01:05:06,000 --> 01:05:06,640
After we see it,

1718
01:05:06,640 --> 01:05:08,480
we'll first help the one
who saw it complete it.

1719
01:05:09,400 --> 01:05:09,840
Found it.

1720
01:05:11,560 --> 01:05:12,680
♪Give me a cup of forgetfulness water♪

1721
01:05:12,680 --> 01:05:14,720
(Singing across the distance)
♪Give me a cup of forgetfulness water♪

1722
01:05:14,720 --> 01:05:17,040
- ♪In exchange for a night without tears♪
- ♪In exchange for a night without tears♪

1723
01:05:17,320 --> 01:05:19,880
♪My heart is clear to see♪

1724
01:05:19,880 --> 01:05:22,680
(Cross-screen harmony)
♪Longing for a true love♪

1725
01:05:22,848 --> 01:05:25,888
(Verification successful)

1726
01:05:26,080 --> 01:05:26,520
Yuwen.

1727
01:05:27,880 --> 01:05:29,120
I have a red mirror here.

1728
01:05:29,520 --> 01:05:31,000
Can you help me verify?

1729
01:05:31,000 --> 01:05:32,600
Okay, can you help me verify?

1730
01:05:32,600 --> 01:05:33,880
But why are you being so kind?

1731
01:05:34,960 --> 01:05:35,840
Can I trust you?

1732
01:05:36,640 --> 01:05:37,200
You can.

1733
01:05:37,760 --> 01:05:39,080
You help me verify first.

1734
01:05:39,080 --> 01:05:41,640
Then we'll look for red mirrors
together.

1735
01:05:43,640 --> 01:05:44,040
Okay.

1736
01:05:44,040 --> 01:05:44,440
Okay.

1737
01:05:44,603 --> 01:05:45,560
(Approaching)

1738
01:05:46,200 --> 01:05:46,840
Wait a second.

1739
01:05:48,120 --> 01:05:48,640
Wait a second.

1740
01:05:49,640 --> 01:05:50,680
Yuwen.

1741
01:05:50,680 --> 01:05:52,000
Wait, can you not touch me?

1742
01:05:52,000 --> 01:05:53,240
Just be a little further away.

1743
01:05:54,520 --> 01:05:54,920
What's wrong?

1744
01:05:54,920 --> 01:05:55,920
How can we verify if I'm further away?

1745
01:05:55,920 --> 01:05:56,920
You stretch your hand over,

1746
01:05:56,920 --> 01:05:58,000
but don't you come over.

1747
01:05:58,000 --> 01:05:59,880
Let's just try
to avoid physical contact.

1748
01:05:59,880 --> 01:06:00,704
Okay, fine.

1749
01:06:00,704 --> 01:06:01,280
Alright.

1750
01:06:01,280 --> 01:06:02,600
As far as possible, okay?

1751
01:06:02,880 --> 01:06:04,000
I can see you from the mirror.

1752
01:06:04,000 --> 01:06:05,560
Don't make small moves.

1753
01:06:06,040 --> 01:06:07,240
(Forced perspective verification)
This is a good trick.

1754
01:06:07,240 --> 01:06:07,880
Okay.

1755
01:06:07,880 --> 01:06:08,360
A little closer.

1756
01:06:08,600 --> 01:06:09,640
Three, two, one.

1757
01:06:13,664 --> 01:06:14,560
(Guo Jingfei suddenly appears,
interrupting the verification)

1758
01:06:14,560 --> 01:06:14,840
Go.

1759
01:06:15,732 --> 01:06:17,152
(Change of plans, retreat)

1760
01:06:20,280 --> 01:06:20,680
You two.

1761
01:06:20,680 --> 01:06:21,440
I just saw you.

1762
01:06:21,880 --> 01:06:23,120
Neither of you is out.

1763
01:06:23,120 --> 01:06:24,240
So, neither of you is the killer,

1764
01:06:24,240 --> 01:06:24,640
right?

1765
01:06:25,472 --> 01:06:26,705
(Keeping distance)

1766
01:06:26,920 --> 01:06:28,520
Can I join your group?

1767
01:06:28,520 --> 01:06:29,728
(A team-up invitation)

1768
01:06:30,480 --> 01:06:31,160
Well, you guys can help me,

1769
01:06:31,160 --> 01:06:32,560
because I can't be the first...

1770
01:06:32,560 --> 01:06:33,680
Hard to say, bro.

1771
01:06:34,092 --> 01:06:35,349
(Trapped in a dead end)

1772
01:06:35,360 --> 01:06:36,560
You step back first.

1773
01:06:36,560 --> 01:06:37,800
You want to kill two at once?

1774
01:06:37,800 --> 01:06:39,080
Bro, you have two bullets.

1775
01:06:39,080 --> 01:06:40,920
Will you use them both on us two?

1776
01:06:40,920 --> 01:06:42,320
How did you corner us two

1777
01:06:42,840 --> 01:06:43,880
into this dead end?

1778
01:06:43,880 --> 01:06:45,280
Let's go find a mirror, bro.

1779
01:06:46,280 --> 01:06:46,840
(Running away at light speed)
Quick, find one.

1780
01:06:47,880 --> 01:06:48,520
Find a mirror.

1781
01:06:48,520 --> 01:06:48,960
Look for it.

1782
01:06:50,752 --> 01:06:51,840
(Rushing into the crowd)

1783
01:06:52,520 --> 01:06:53,160
Why are you running?

1784
01:06:53,160 --> 01:06:53,800
Running.

1785
01:06:56,360 --> 01:06:57,200
(Following closely)
It's really not me.

1786
01:06:57,680 --> 01:06:59,040
Because I can't even
understand the game rules.

1787
01:06:59,240 --> 01:07:00,520
How come he's not anxious at all?

1788
01:07:00,880 --> 01:07:02,400
Yeah, and he's looking by himself.

1789
01:07:03,040 --> 01:07:04,600
Like us two, we definitely

1790
01:07:04,600 --> 01:07:05,640
would try to help each other
find a mirror.

1791
01:07:05,640 --> 01:07:06,640
If he finds one,

1792
01:07:06,640 --> 01:07:07,880
who can make a call for him?

1793
01:07:08,960 --> 01:07:10,200
Have you completed it, Fei?

1794
01:07:10,200 --> 01:07:10,760
Not yet.

1795
01:07:11,240 --> 01:07:12,080
It's really not me.

1796
01:07:12,600 --> 01:07:13,400
I don't have a mirror yet.

1797
01:07:15,360 --> 01:07:15,880
Come here.

1798
01:07:18,600 --> 01:07:19,360
I have one here, come on.

1799
01:07:21,160 --> 01:07:21,840
(Choosing to trust Fei)
Okay, I'll help you first.

1800
01:07:25,200 --> 01:07:26,120
I'll verify you, no problem.

1801
01:07:26,720 --> 01:07:28,448
(Mysterious gesture)

1802
01:07:29,920 --> 01:07:31,680
♪As long as it's sincere♪

1803
01:07:32,520 --> 01:07:33,000
No problem.

1804
01:07:34,160 --> 01:07:35,520
Why are you poking my chin?

1805
01:07:35,520 --> 01:07:36,320
I'm just poking blindly.

1806
01:07:36,320 --> 01:07:37,680
Anyway, as long as my hand is in there,
that's fine, right?

1807
01:07:40,560 --> 01:07:40,880
Okay.

1808
01:07:41,088 --> 01:07:42,810
(Hesitated for a second and believed it)

1809
01:07:43,480 --> 01:07:44,320
Can you still verify me?

1810
01:07:44,440 --> 01:07:44,920
Sure.

1811
01:07:44,920 --> 01:07:45,200
Okay.

1812
01:07:48,800 --> 01:07:50,800
♪Longing for a true love♪

1813
01:07:50,800 --> 01:07:51,320
You're dead.

1814
01:07:51,920 --> 01:07:52,440
You're dead.

1815
01:07:58,880 --> 01:07:59,400
I'm just messing with you.

1816
01:07:59,400 --> 01:08:00,720
I was so scared.

1817
01:08:03,000 --> 01:08:04,960
You really scared me.

1818
01:08:06,560 --> 01:08:07,040
For real?

1819
01:08:07,720 --> 01:08:08,520
No.

1820
01:08:09,504 --> 01:08:10,800
(Verified: Chen Xingxu, Li Naiwen, Song Qian,
Sun Honglei, Liu Yuning, Lin Yi, Guo Jingfei)

1821
01:08:10,800 --> 01:08:11,720
Are there any more mirrors?

1822
01:08:12,560 --> 01:08:13,320
There's one outside.

1823
01:08:13,320 --> 01:08:13,920
Come on, I'll show you.

1824
01:08:14,320 --> 01:08:15,440
You scared me.

1825
01:08:17,200 --> 01:08:17,720
I took it seriously.

1826
01:08:18,080 --> 01:08:18,720
I'll verify you.

1827
01:08:19,392 --> 01:08:20,576
(You get what you ask for)

1828
01:08:21,080 --> 01:08:21,439
Thanks, Fei.

1829
01:08:21,840 --> 01:08:22,120
Sing.

1830
01:08:23,168 --> 01:08:24,920
(Again)

1831
01:08:24,920 --> 01:08:25,960
Your gesture is weird.

1832
01:08:25,960 --> 01:08:26,720
Sorry.

1833
01:08:27,439 --> 01:08:27,720
Wait a moment.

1834
01:08:29,040 --> 01:08:31,800
It's fine. Since he's making
this gesture, just sing.

1835
01:08:31,800 --> 01:08:32,479
(In broad daylight)
We're right here.

1836
01:08:32,479 --> 01:08:32,960
Yes.

1837
01:08:33,479 --> 01:08:33,840
Come on.

1838
01:08:34,319 --> 01:08:34,960
You sing.

1839
01:08:34,960 --> 01:08:39,040
♪You ask me how much I love you♪

1840
01:08:39,040 --> 01:08:39,720
You're dead.

1841
01:08:42,080 --> 01:08:42,720
What do you mean?

1842
01:08:42,720 --> 01:08:44,080
I'll expose myself
because I'm not afraid of you.

1843
01:08:44,352 --> 01:08:45,984
(Public self-exposure)

1844
01:08:53,520 --> 01:08:54,240
Just kidding.

1845
01:08:54,720 --> 01:08:55,600
It's fine, it's fine.

1846
01:08:56,080 --> 01:08:58,560
He scared me like that just now.

1847
01:09:00,319 --> 01:09:01,479
He gestured like this.

1848
01:09:01,479 --> 01:09:02,840
I was like, what is this?

1849
01:09:02,840 --> 01:09:04,240
So mean.

1850
01:09:05,560 --> 01:09:06,359
What? You're the killer?

1851
01:09:06,848 --> 01:09:08,864
(What is Guo Jingfei's role?)

1852
01:09:11,776 --> 01:09:13,408
(Escaped painting)

1853
01:09:13,952 --> 01:09:15,040
(Just loves to joke)

1854
01:09:17,280 --> 01:09:19,904
(Security Guard)

1855
01:09:21,088 --> 01:09:23,424
(Fully disguised Security Guard)

1856
01:09:23,560 --> 01:09:24,359
What? You're the killer?

1857
01:09:24,560 --> 01:09:24,960
I'm not.

1858
01:09:25,152 --> 01:09:26,496
(Just loves to play)

1859
01:09:27,008 --> 01:09:29,888
(Observing secretly)

1860
01:09:34,160 --> 01:09:35,399
I just think it's so fun.

1861
01:09:36,080 --> 01:09:36,960
(This round's Security Guard: Wang Yuwen)
All members are verified.

1862
01:09:37,439 --> 01:09:38,960
The second round starts now.

1863
01:09:39,600 --> 01:09:41,479
In this round, the Security Guard
has unlimited bullets.

1864
01:09:41,728 --> 01:09:44,480
(Round 2 rule: The Security Guard
has unlimited bullets)

1865
01:09:45,800 --> 01:09:46,800
The valid mirror

1866
01:09:46,800 --> 01:09:48,000
has a red sticker.

1867
01:09:48,000 --> 01:09:49,000
(This round's verification mirror: Red)

1868
01:09:49,000 --> 01:09:50,840
Why is it still a red sticker?

1869
01:09:53,088 --> 01:09:55,680
(Observing Painting's progress...)

1870
01:09:55,680 --> 01:09:58,080
♪If the heart is tired, tears dry up♪

1871
01:09:58,080 --> 01:09:58,720
(Verified: Liu Yuning)

1872
01:09:58,720 --> 01:09:59,120
Okay.

1873
01:09:59,120 --> 01:10:00,896
(Verified: Liu Yuning)

1874
01:10:00,896 --> 01:10:02,656
(This round, the Security Guard
has unlimited bullets)

1875
01:10:04,000 --> 01:10:04,400
Bye bye.

1876
01:10:05,040 --> 01:10:05,560
Bye bye.

1877
01:10:06,280 --> 01:10:06,800
Bye bye.

1878
01:10:06,800 --> 01:10:09,440
(Sun Honglei, Lin Yi,
and Guo Jingfei eliminated)

1879
01:10:11,400 --> 01:10:13,320
In this round, the Security Guard
has unlimited bullets.

1880
01:10:13,320 --> 01:10:15,360
(Using unlimited bullets
to instantly kill three)

1881
01:10:15,360 --> 01:10:16,280
(What happened?)

1882
01:10:16,280 --> 01:10:17,240
Three dead at once.

1883
01:10:18,400 --> 01:10:18,840
Really?

1884
01:10:21,120 --> 01:10:21,640
Come here.

1885
01:10:25,080 --> 01:10:25,640
For real?

1886
01:10:27,040 --> 01:10:27,520
Really?

1887
01:10:27,520 --> 01:10:28,960
(Still unable to accept it)

1888
01:10:29,280 --> 01:10:32,736
(Obediently follows)

1889
01:10:33,440 --> 01:10:33,920
Wait, wait a moment.

1890
01:10:34,320 --> 01:10:34,720
Is this real?

1891
01:10:35,400 --> 01:10:35,920
For real?

1892
01:10:36,480 --> 01:10:36,680
Get in.

1893
01:10:37,160 --> 01:10:37,800
I need to go in too?

1894
01:10:37,800 --> 01:10:38,200
Yes.

1895
01:10:39,160 --> 01:10:40,080
Hurry up.

1896
01:10:42,600 --> 01:10:43,600
Three dead at once.

1897
01:10:44,200 --> 01:10:45,680
(Turning around coolly)
You died a long time ago over there, right?

1898
01:10:50,480 --> 01:10:51,480
We're all dead.

1899
01:10:51,480 --> 01:10:52,320
We're now hidden here.

1900
01:10:52,960 --> 01:10:53,560
Wiped out in one go.

1901
01:10:55,960 --> 01:10:56,920
I'm dead.

1902
01:10:57,440 --> 01:10:58,280
I'm dead too.

1903
01:10:58,280 --> 01:10:59,040
I'm dead.

1904
01:11:01,360 --> 01:11:02,240
(Still hasn't processed it)
Why are the three of us standing together?

1905
01:11:02,240 --> 01:11:03,920
Of the three of us,
I was the first to die.

1906
01:11:05,120 --> 01:11:06,200
But her killing action

1907
01:11:06,200 --> 01:11:07,680
was exactly the same
as when you scared me just now.

1908
01:11:07,680 --> 01:11:08,440
(Look at her, and look at you)

1909
01:11:08,440 --> 01:11:08,960
Just like that,

1910
01:11:08,960 --> 01:11:10,040
three of us were dead.

1911
01:11:10,040 --> 01:11:10,960
(Futile rage)
She's so fierce.

1912
01:11:11,560 --> 01:11:13,560
She waited for the last round
with unlimited bullets.

1913
01:11:13,600 --> 01:11:15,640
(Totally awesome)

1914
01:11:15,640 --> 01:11:17,320
Naiwen, come quickly
and do the mission with me.

1915
01:11:17,320 --> 01:11:18,560
Quickly, where's Naiwen?

1916
01:11:18,560 --> 01:11:19,160
(A little occupied)
Naiwen.

1917
01:11:20,360 --> 01:11:21,000
Hurry up.

1918
01:11:21,320 --> 01:11:21,920
Hurry up.

1919
01:11:22,440 --> 01:11:23,040
(A rare chance for Qian)
Naiwen.

1920
01:11:24,280 --> 01:11:25,800
