2472
01:29:44,600 --> 01:29:46,120
The valid mirrors for this round

2473
01:29:46,120 --> 01:29:47,640
(Everyone spreads out)
are the ones with blue stickers.

2474
01:29:48,280 --> 01:29:49,560
Honglei, there's a mirror over there.

2475
01:29:49,560 --> 01:29:49,960
Let's go quickly.

2476
01:29:51,520 --> 01:29:52,320
Quickly.

2477
01:29:52,320 --> 01:29:53,160
Quickly, let's go.

2478
01:29:58,280 --> 01:29:59,200
I'm so scared.

2479
01:30:02,520 --> 01:30:03,640
I won't talk. Don't worry.

2480
01:30:03,640 --> 01:30:04,920
I respect the game.

2481
01:30:05,360 --> 01:30:06,320
But I didn't expect you

2482
01:30:06,440 --> 01:30:06,880
to deceive me.

2483
01:30:09,080 --> 01:30:10,240
I'm just too trusting of people.

2484
01:30:10,304 --> 01:30:11,760
(Earth Group's honest person)

2485
01:30:11,760 --> 01:30:12,920
I think it's Lin Yi.

2486
01:30:12,920 --> 01:30:13,720
(Honest person No. 2)

2487
01:30:13,720 --> 01:30:14,360
Really?

2488
01:30:14,360 --> 01:30:16,520
The way he looked at me
just now was off.

2489
01:30:16,880 --> 01:30:18,000
I remember just now inside,

2490
01:30:18,000 --> 01:30:19,240
at the beginning,

2491
01:30:19,240 --> 01:30:20,680
I saw one at the starting location.

2492
01:30:20,680 --> 01:30:22,520
But I'm not very daring to go inside.

2493
01:30:24,040 --> 01:30:25,320
Fei, you can move freely?

2494
01:30:25,568 --> 01:30:26,240
(A chance has come)

2495
01:30:26,240 --> 01:30:27,320
I'm stretching my legs.

2496
01:30:28,192 --> 01:30:29,960
(Waiting for the right moment to act)

2497
01:30:29,960 --> 01:30:31,400
But I don't dare to be alone, Honglei.

2498
01:30:31,400 --> 01:30:32,280
(Requesting protection)
Can you follow me?

2499
01:30:32,320 --> 01:30:34,080
(Following closely behind)

2500
01:30:34,080 --> 01:30:35,720
(Unable to make a move)

2501
01:30:35,720 --> 01:30:36,680
Yes, better to move in pairs.

2502
01:30:37,088 --> 01:30:38,784
(Waiting for another chance)

2503
01:30:43,640 --> 01:30:44,120
Who left?

2504
01:30:45,480 --> 01:30:46,440
Weren't you sitting there?

2505
01:30:46,440 --> 01:30:47,240
What's wrong with me moving around?

2506
01:30:47,240 --> 01:30:47,960
(Interrupting my plan)

2507
01:30:47,960 --> 01:30:49,080
Then it's you, right?

2508
01:30:49,080 --> 01:30:50,000
Then it must be you.

2509
01:30:50,400 --> 01:30:51,200
What are you afraid of?

2510
01:30:51,440 --> 01:30:53,400
Soon, eight guns will be aimed at you.

2511
01:30:53,792 --> 01:30:55,680
(Hellish mode on)

2512
01:30:55,680 --> 01:30:57,080
Look, they're all wary of you.

2513
01:30:58,160 --> 01:30:59,320
They're all in pairs.

2514
01:30:59,320 --> 01:31:00,360
It's hard for me to make a move.

2515
01:31:00,360 --> 01:31:00,880
(Very tricky)

2516
01:31:00,880 --> 01:31:01,920
I can only wait for them to come over.

2517
01:31:02,840 --> 01:31:03,920
Find a place to hide.

2518
01:31:04,880 --> 01:31:05,960
Catch them off guard.

2519
01:31:07,960 --> 01:31:08,840
You better give them

2520
01:31:08,840 --> 01:31:09,520
a surprise attack.

2521
01:31:09,840 --> 01:31:10,760
That's the only way.

2522
01:31:12,400 --> 01:31:13,160
I'm too kind.

2523
01:31:14,760 --> 01:31:15,960
Five-minute countdown.

2524
01:31:15,960 --> 01:31:18,040
Unverified paintings will be out.

2525
01:31:23,712 --> 01:31:25,184
(Prey locked on)

2526
01:31:28,040 --> 01:31:29,360
Yuning, do the mission first. Yuning.

2527
01:31:40,280 --> 01:31:41,040
There's one over there.

2528
01:31:41,040 --> 01:31:42,120
What color is it this round?

2529
01:31:42,120 --> 01:31:42,560
Blue.

2530
01:31:42,560 --> 01:31:42,880
Blue.

2531
01:31:42,880 --> 01:31:43,360
Blue?

2532
01:31:55,320 --> 01:31:55,960
Goodbye.

2533
01:31:57,920 --> 01:31:58,680
Goodbye.

2534
01:31:58,680 --> 01:32:02,112
(Security Guard: Guo Jingfei.
Song Qian and Chen Xingxu are out)

2535
01:32:02,336 --> 01:32:03,936
(No more hiding)

2536
01:32:04,120 --> 01:32:05,000
An ambush?

2537
01:32:05,600 --> 01:32:07,560
Ambushing is really ruthless.

2538
01:32:08,080 --> 01:32:09,240
You ambushed me.

2539
01:32:11,600 --> 01:32:12,400
Did you find a mirror?

2540
01:32:13,200 --> 01:32:14,240
Quick, help me.

2541
01:32:14,760 --> 01:32:17,720
(Successfully verified)
♪Longing for a true love♪

2542
01:32:17,720 --> 01:32:19,160
Found it.

2543
01:32:19,920 --> 01:32:21,520
(Successfully verified)
♪Oh baby, say a little more sweet talk♪

2544
01:32:21,520 --> 01:32:22,360
There's one over there. Hurry.

2545
01:32:23,040 --> 01:32:23,960
I just saw it.

2546
01:32:26,000 --> 01:32:28,480
♪The deeper my love for you♪

2547
01:32:28,480 --> 01:32:29,360
♪The more my heart aches♪

2548
01:32:29,360 --> 01:32:31,200
(Successfully verified)
Honglei, sing quickly.

2549
01:32:31,200 --> 01:32:31,720
Sing quickly.

2550
01:32:33,000 --> 01:32:33,320
Let's go quickly.

2551
01:32:33,320 --> 01:32:34,040
Let's go.

2552
01:32:34,280 --> 01:32:35,120
It really isn't me.

2553
01:32:37,080 --> 01:32:38,080
Goodbye.

2554
01:32:38,080 --> 01:32:41,120
(Sun Honglei out)

2555
01:32:41,120 --> 01:32:42,000
(Sadly losing a teammate)
You guys quickly find a mirror

2556
01:32:42,000 --> 01:32:42,720
and help me complete it, okay?

2557
01:32:42,720 --> 01:32:43,160
I know.

2558
01:32:43,160 --> 01:32:43,640
You find it first.

2559
01:32:44,440 --> 01:32:45,720
I'll help you.

2560
01:32:47,040 --> 01:32:47,600
Don't run.

2561
01:32:51,640 --> 01:32:52,080
Goodbye.

2562
01:32:52,080 --> 01:32:54,640
(Wang Yuwen out)

2563
01:32:54,640 --> 01:32:55,560
Is it over already?

2564
01:32:55,560 --> 01:32:55,880
Yes.

2565
01:32:57,200 --> 01:32:58,200
It scared me to death.

2566
01:33:02,400 --> 01:33:04,120
You must hang on until the end.

2567
01:33:04,680 --> 01:33:05,440
The last two people.

2568
01:33:05,960 --> 01:33:07,320
You two are out?

2569
01:33:07,320 --> 01:33:07,840
Dead.

2570
01:33:08,040 --> 01:33:08,840
Both of us are out.

2571
01:33:08,840 --> 01:33:09,160
Dead.

2572
01:33:11,240 --> 01:33:12,000
You're out too?

2573
01:33:12,000 --> 01:33:12,560
No, I'm "alive".

2574
01:33:13,840 --> 01:33:14,960
Then wait for the end.

2575
01:33:14,960 --> 01:33:15,320
Okay.

2576
01:33:16,360 --> 01:33:16,600
Well,

2577
01:33:16,600 --> 01:33:18,040
the problem is
I haven't finished the mission.

2578
01:33:18,816 --> 01:33:21,600
(Can't find a companion,
the mission is in jeopardy)

2579
01:33:30,440 --> 01:33:31,040
Goodbye.

2580
01:33:31,040 --> 01:33:32,851
(Liu Yuning out)

2581
01:33:33,600 --> 01:33:35,040
You still dare to be alone?

2582
01:33:35,040 --> 01:33:35,600
One more left.

2583
01:33:36,040 --> 01:33:37,040
One more left, Lin Yi.

2584
01:33:38,600 --> 01:33:39,320
Round two is over.

2585
01:33:39,320 --> 01:33:42,160
The paintings gain
one counterattack bullet.

2586
01:33:43,840 --> 01:33:44,600
(Li Naiwen and Lin Yi vs. Guo Jingfei)
Three more are left?

2587
01:33:47,480 --> 01:33:48,840
Everyone, as long as you use your hand

2588
01:33:48,840 --> 01:33:51,600
to touch the opponent's body,
you can eliminate them.

2589
01:34:01,760 --> 01:34:02,912
(Ambush set)

2590
01:34:25,120 --> 01:34:25,640
I touched you first.

2591
01:34:25,640 --> 01:34:26,240
I touched you.

2592
01:34:26,240 --> 01:34:26,960
I touched you.

2593
01:34:29,888 --> 01:34:31,998
(Nainai touched first)

2594
01:34:32,039 --> 01:34:33,504
(Successfully escaped)

2595
01:34:33,504 --> 01:34:35,000
(Guo Jingfei out)

2596
01:34:35,000 --> 01:34:36,000
Did you counter-attack?

2597
01:34:36,000 --> 01:34:36,360
Yes.

2598
01:34:36,920 --> 01:34:38,120
Nai, impressive.

2599
01:34:39,000 --> 01:34:39,640
I was there all along.

2600
01:34:40,120 --> 01:34:41,000
I was hiding there all along.

2601
01:34:41,920 --> 01:34:42,360
Where's Lin Yi?

2602
01:34:42,656 --> 01:34:45,984
(Still lying in ambush)

2603
01:34:53,440 --> 01:34:54,520
Hunting time.

2604
01:34:58,688 --> 01:35:00,224
(Serpentine movement)

2605
01:35:05,960 --> 01:35:07,760
The paintings escaped successfully.

2606
01:35:07,760 --> 01:35:08,720
(What happened to the hunt?)

2607
01:35:08,720 --> 01:35:09,680
Game over.

2608
01:35:10,360 --> 01:35:11,320
(Burned for nothing)
He finally showed up.

2609
01:35:12,120 --> 01:35:13,200
Naiwen is so awesome?

2610
01:35:13,200 --> 01:35:13,880
So cool.

2611
01:35:13,880 --> 01:35:16,560
Actually, even if we had touched
each other at the same time just now,

2612
01:35:17,040 --> 01:35:18,240
it'd have been a one-for-one trade.

2613
01:35:18,560 --> 01:35:19,040
Right.

2614
01:35:22,000 --> 01:35:23,440
I was really frightened by Fei.

2615
01:35:24,560 --> 01:35:25,000
Right.

2616
01:35:25,000 --> 01:35:25,960
As soon as I came out,

2617
01:35:25,960 --> 01:35:27,320
I turned my head and saw a big face.

2618
01:35:27,320 --> 01:35:28,440
He came straight at me like this.

2619
01:35:29,320 --> 01:35:30,440
He was like a goofy roe deer, you know?

2620
01:35:30,440 --> 01:35:31,320
He could have run away.

2621
01:35:31,320 --> 01:35:32,280
Once I pressed on his face...

2622
01:35:34,880 --> 01:35:35,680
He froze.

2623
01:35:35,680 --> 01:35:36,240
He froze.

2624
01:35:36,240 --> 01:35:37,480
It was just too scary.

2625
01:35:37,480 --> 01:35:38,440
My soul bolted first.

2626
01:35:39,160 --> 01:35:40,160
Two goofy roe deer.

2627
01:35:40,160 --> 01:35:40,960
Yuning also froze.

2628
01:35:41,600 --> 01:35:42,320
He didn't run.

2629
01:35:50,600 --> 01:35:52,520
(The moonlight of Paris does not belong)

2630
01:35:52,520 --> 01:35:53,840
(to the world inside the frames.)

2631
01:35:53,840 --> 01:35:55,160
(When the midnight bell tolls,)

2632
01:35:55,520 --> 01:35:57,440
(they must return to the frozen)

2633
01:35:57,440 --> 01:35:58,640
(postures and expressions.)

2634
01:36:02,680 --> 01:36:04,040
(But don't feel sorry for them,)

2635
01:36:04,560 --> 01:36:07,120
(because the wind remembers
the way they ran,)

2636
01:36:07,120 --> 01:36:09,400
(the Seine River remembers
the reflections they cast,)

2637
01:36:11,800 --> 01:36:13,320
(and the night of Paris)

2638
01:36:13,320 --> 01:36:13,920
(will remember)

2639
01:36:13,920 --> 01:36:16,080
(this wonderful night for them.)

2640
01:36:34,760 --> 01:36:36,400
(Next Episode Preview)
Your ultimate mission today

2641
01:36:36,400 --> 01:36:38,080
is to complete a fashion show.

2642
01:36:38,080 --> 01:36:39,040
Tickets for sale?

2643
01:36:39,320 --> 01:36:40,520
Can we sell the tickets?

2644
01:36:41,160 --> 01:36:41,800
Next,

2645
01:36:41,800 --> 01:36:43,960
let's test the team's
internal chemistry.

2646
01:36:43,960 --> 01:36:44,760
Twist.

2647
01:36:44,760 --> 01:36:46,600
Start twisting.

2648
01:36:49,600 --> 01:36:50,360
Now,

2649
01:36:50,360 --> 01:36:51,680
on the left side of your chest.

2650
01:36:51,920 --> 01:36:52,800
Is this okay?

2651
01:36:53,760 --> 01:36:54,280
Not okay.

2652
01:36:55,760 --> 01:36:56,480
It's okay.

2653
01:36:56,560 --> 01:36:57,680
Your thumb and index finger.

2654
01:36:57,680 --> 01:36:58,280
Take them out. Yes.

2655
01:36:58,280 --> 01:36:59,760
Place them at the corners of his mouth.

2656
01:37:02,176 --> 01:37:03,458
(Which team will win in the end?)

2657
01:37:03,480 --> 01:37:04,000
Now,

2658
01:37:04,000 --> 01:37:05,960
go prepare for your big show.

2659
01:37:05,960 --> 01:37:06,520
I think

2660
01:37:06,520 --> 01:37:08,520
we don't necessarily
have to buy clothes.

2661
01:37:08,520 --> 01:37:09,640
We can buy some curtains

2662
01:37:09,640 --> 01:37:11,120
and drape them over ourselves.

2663
01:37:11,120 --> 01:37:12,080
You're right.

2664
01:37:12,080 --> 01:37:13,120
It might not even fit me.

2665
01:37:13,120 --> 01:37:14,040
Pair it with a silk scarf.

2666
01:37:14,320 --> 01:37:16,280
What tie goes with a black shirt?

2667
01:37:16,280 --> 01:37:17,560
Do you want a tie or...

2668
01:37:17,560 --> 01:37:17,960
or a silk scarf?

2669
01:37:18,120 --> 01:37:18,960
I want a tie.

2670
01:37:19,520 --> 01:37:20,840
The countdown
to the fashion show begins.

2671
01:37:21,080 --> 01:37:21,960
I've seen shows,

2672
01:37:21,960 --> 01:37:22,520
but I've never hosted one.

2673
01:37:22,520 --> 01:37:23,600
but I've never hosted one.

2674
01:37:23,600 --> 01:37:25,120
I've basically never even watched one.

2675
01:37:25,120 --> 01:37:26,600
This is the design for the stage.

2676
01:37:26,880 --> 01:37:27,920
Where is the audience area?

2677
01:37:27,920 --> 01:37:28,920
I can't understand it at all.

2678
01:37:28,920 --> 01:37:29,680
Let's first think of a story

2679
01:37:29,680 --> 01:37:30,680
to tie all things together.

2680
01:37:30,800 --> 01:37:32,080
We can change clothes here, right?

2681
01:37:33,840 --> 01:37:34,840
Come on, let's walk now.

2682
01:37:34,840 --> 01:37:35,200
Okay.

2683
01:37:35,200 --> 01:37:35,920
Let's just walk.

2684
01:37:35,920 --> 01:37:37,152
(Stay tuned
for the Earth Group's big show)

2685
01:37:37,152 --> 01:38:11,872
(Wow The World, show schedule)
